    <briefdescription>
<para>Iterative agentic Q&amp;A engine for process instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_graph_rag" kindref="compound">ProcessGraphRag</ref> and AgenticRAG to provide multi-hop question answering over running Verwaltungsvorgänge.</para>
<para>Typical usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ProcessAgenticConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_iterations<sp/>=<sp/>3;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_agentic_rag_1ac749fe8679318dbe5a4bbf3f0a81be77" kindref="member">ProcessAgenticRag</ref><sp/>agent(graph_rag,<sp/>cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>agent.iterativeQuery(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;inst-42&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Was<sp/>fehlt<sp/>noch<sp/>für<sp/>den<sp/>Bauantrag?&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>result.llm_prompt<sp/>is<sp/>ready<sp/>to<sp/>send<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>LLM</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
